{"info": {"address1": "Office No. 501 to 511", "address2": "Harshit Corporate 5th Floor,Amanaka", "city": "Raipur", "zip": "492001", "country": "India", "phone": "91 77 1222 2360", "website": "https://www.sambhv.com", "industry": "Steel", "industryKey": "steel", "industryDisp": "Steel", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Sambhv Steel Tubes Limited manufactures and sells electric resistance welded steel pipes, structural tubes, and stainless-steel coils in India. The company provides mild steel hot-rolled coil, cold rolled coil, and galvanized coils; ERW steel tubes and pipes, including rectangular tubes, round tubes, and square tubes; cold rolled full hard pipes, comprising rectangular pipes, round pipes, and square pipes; and steel door frames, which comprise single, double, and four door frames. It also offers stainless-steel hot-rolled, hot rolled annealed and pickled, and cold rolled coils; superior galvanised and pre-galvanised pipes, such as Gi rectangular, round, and square; and intermediate products, which includes sponge iron and stainless-steel billets/blooms/slabs. In addition, the company operates waste heat recovery boiler and atmospheric fluidized bed combustion boiler-based power plants, as well as generates the electricity. The company was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Raipur, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Suresh Kumar Goyal", "age": 49, "title": "Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 18000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vikas Kumar Goyal", "age": 44, "title": "MD, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1981, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 18000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Anu  Garg", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bhavesh Mah